      "description": "Graduate Assistant-School of Nursing - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Graduate Assistant-School of Nursing - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Graduate Assistant-School of Nursing 497780 Richmond Campus College of Health Sciences Graduate Assistant Closing at: Jan 9 2027 - 23:55 EST Title: Graduate Assistant-School of Nursing Position Type: Graduate Assistant Search Type: Internal - minimum 5 days Department: 24R000 - College of Health Sciences Division: 2R0000 - Academic Affairs Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver Hours Per Week: 20 Contact Person: Angie Wheeler Job Summary/Basic Functions Graduate Assistant will assist with: Area # 1- program planning (white coat ceremony, pinning ceremony & hooding ceremony, SON social media, recruiting, program development/outreach, department news letter, creating digital/print material and guides, general office duties, etc. AND/OR Area # 2 – assist with undergraduate skills & assessment labs, lead tutoring sessions, proctor exams, assist with preparation of teaching material and learning resources, grade class assignments from a rubric, and make presentations as part of a regular class session. Minimum Qualifications Licensure & Certifications: Must be enrolled at EKU. Preferred Qualifications: Must be a graduate level student, pay attention to detail, self motivated. Job Duties: Sponsorship: This position is not eligible for visa sponsorship. Open Until Filled: Yes EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational institution and does not discriminate on the basis of age (40 and over), race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, ethnicity, disability, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information in the admission to, or participation in, any educational program or activity (e.g., athletics, academics and housing) which it conduct