    "https://careers.eku.edu/jobs/executive-director-budgeting-and-financial-planning-richmond-campus-kentucky-united-states": {
      "title": "Executive Director, Budgeting and Financial Planning",
      "description": "Executive Director, Budgeting and Financial Planning - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Executive Director, Budgeting and Financial Planning - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Executive Director, Budgeting and Financial Planning 497775 Richmond Campus Financial Positions Fulltime Staff Title: Executive Director, Budgeting and Financial Planning Position Type: Fulltime Staff Search Type: External - minimum 7 days Department: 66R000 - Budgeting & Financial Planning Division: 4R0000 - Financial Affairs Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver FLSA: Exempt Schedule Type: Full Time (37.5 hrs per week or more) Hours Per Week: Additional Schedule Details: Posted Salary Grade: Exempt - G28 Retirement: KTRS Contact Person: Jackie Dudley Job Summary/Basic Functions Under the general supervision of the Vice President of Finance, the Executive Director of Budgeting and Financial Planning provides analytical support for financial planning and resource allocation decision-making and is responsible for the development, preparation, analysis and tracking of the University’s general operating budget. Minimum Qualifications Education: Bachelor's degree in a related field. Master's degree or CPA preferred. Experience: Experience in a not-for-profit, higher education, audit or related consulting practice. Licensure & Certifications: Preferred Qualifications: Job Duties: 45% - Provides analytical support for financial planning and resource allocation decision-making. - (Essential) 50% - Responsible for the development, preparation, analysis, and tracking of the University’s operating budgets - (Essential) 5% - Ensures the effective operation of the University by completing other duties as assigned. - (Essential) Sponsorship: Funding Source: Institutional Open Until Filled: Yes Special Instructions: EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational instituti