      "title": "Art Studio Technician",
      "description": "Art Studio Technician - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Art Studio Technician - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Art Studio Technician 497768 Richmond Campus College of Letters, Arts & Soc Sciences Student Support Positions Student Closing at: Oct 18 2026 - 23:55 EDT Title: Art Studio Technician Position Type: Student Search Type: External - minimum 7 days Department: 21R010 - College of Letters, Arts & Soc Sci Division: 2R0000 - Academic Affairs Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver Hours Per Week: 10 Posted Salary Grade: Minimum $8 an hour Contact Person: Kelly Gallardo Job Summary/Basic Functions This position may assist with multiple studio's. Responsibilities include general studio maintenance and organization under the supervision of Studio Professors. Weekly duties vary but include light cleaning, non-hazardous chemical mixing, tool repair, and assistance with classroom demonstration materials. Minimum Qualifications Education: Completion of ART 210, 230, 240, 270, or 290 preferred. Licensure & Certifications: Must be an EKU student Sponsorship: This position is not eligible for visa sponsorship. Open Until Filled: No EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational institution and does not discriminate on the basis of age (40 and over), race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, ethnicity, disability, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information in the admission to, or participation in, any educational program or activity (e.g., athletics, academics and housing) which it conducts or any employment policy or practice. Background Check Statement Offers of employment are contingent upon a satisfactory background check. Apply now! Sign up for job alerts! Job Alert e7f8f6e2 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multipl