    "https://careers.eku.edu/jobs/director-enterprise-platform-services-richmond-campus-kentucky-united-states": {
      "title": "Director, Enterprise Platform Services",
      "description": "Director, Enterprise Platform Services - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Director, Enterprise Platform Services - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Director, Enterprise Platform Services 497739 Richmond Campus Administrative Support Positions Technology Positions Fulltime Staff Title: Director, Enterprise Platform Services Position Type: Fulltime Staff Search Type: External - minimum 7 days Department: 52R000 - Information Technology Division: 1R0105 - Information Technology Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver FLSA: Exempt Schedule Type: Full Time (37.5 hrs per week or more) Hours Per Week: Additional Schedule Details: Hybrid Posted Salary Grade: Exempt - G28 Retirement: KTRS Contact Person: Byron Sims Job Summary/Basic Functions Provides strategic and operational leadership for the university's enterprise technology platforms and infrastructure services. Responsibilities include enterprise architecture, cloud strategy, platform modernization, technology roadmaps, service delivery, staff supervision, vendor management, enterprise monitoring, change management, governance, project leadership, enterprise integrations, and collaboration with institutional stakeholders. Minimum Qualifications Education: Bachelor's degree in Information Technology, Computer Information Systems, Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or a closely related field is required. A master's degree is preferred. Experience: Three years of related work experience required. Demonstrated experience in working knowledge of server operating systems and administration, directory services, networking administration, and messaging systems. Licensure & Certifications: Microsoft Azure certifications Microsoft 365 certifications Oracle database certifications VMware certifications Cloud architecture certifications Preferred Qualifications: Job Duties: 35% - Design and implement Enterprise architecture, cloud strategy, and platform modernization. - () 35% - Enterprise Technology Operations, Reliability & Governance - () 30% - Leadership, Portfolio Management & Institutional Partnership - () Sponsorship: This position is not eligible for visa sponsorship. Funding Source: Institutional Open Until Filled: Yes Special Instructions: EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational institution and does not discriminate on the basis of age (40 and over), race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, ethnicity, disability, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information in the admission to, or participation in, any educational program or activity (e.g., athletics, academics and housing) which it conducts or any employment policy or practice. Background Check Statement Offers of employment are contingent upon a satisfactory background check. Apply now! Sign up for job alerts! Job Alert 90ff92bd Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments 52R000 - Information Technology 52R000 - Information Technology Locations Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States First Name (required) 72070949 Last Name (required) 28fbc41d Email (required) 537a9da3 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Similar Jobs Graduate Assistant-School of Nursing Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States 24R000 - College of Health Sciences Graduate Assistant for the School of Nursing Assistant Director, Athletic Marketing Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States 90R000 - Intercollegiate Athletics The Assistant Director of Athletics Marketing is, responsible for developing and implementing creative marketing and promotional strategies that elevate the game day atmosphere, e