    "https://careers.eku.edu/jobs/part-time-faculty-school-of-education-richmond-campus-kentucky-united-states": {
      "title": "Part-Time Faculty, School of Education",
      "description": "Part-Time Faculty, School of Education - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Part-Time Faculty, School of Education - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Part-Time Faculty, School of Education 497745 Richmond Campus College of Education & Applied Human Sciences Part-Time Faculty Closing at: Mar 10 2027 - 23:55 EST Title: Part-Time Faculty, School of Education Position Type: Part-Time Faculty Search Type: External - minimum 7 days Department: 23R000 - College of Ed & Appl Human Sciences Division: 2R0000 - Academic Affairs Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver FLSA: Exempt Schedule Type: Part Time, No Benefits (less than 20 hrs per week) Posted Salary Grade: Part Time Exempt - 01 Retirement: None Contact Person: Rita Land Job Summary/Basic Functions The School of Education at Eastern Kentucky University invites applications for a part-time faculty position to teach courses in Educational Leadership and Policy. Courses may include, but are not limited to: EAD 854: Fair Learning Changes EAD 879: Systems for Change EDL 943: Capacity Building and Organizational Improvement To be considered to teach graduate- and doctoral-level courses, applicants should hold an earned terminal degree (EdD or PhD) in Educational Leadership and Policy from an accredited institution. Applicants will be screened and contacted as departmental needs for part-time faculty arise. Applications will be accepted on an ongoing basis. Unofficial transcripts are acceptable at the time of application. Official transcripts are required at the time of the position offer and as a condition of employment. Minimum Qualifications Education: EdD or PhD in Educational Leadership and Policy Experience: Must have leadership experience in K-12 schools/districts. Must have experience teaching higher education courses. Must be skilled in the use of Canvas. Licensure & Certifications: Terminal degree (EdD or PhD) in Educational Leadership and Policy Preferred Qualifications: Job Duties: Sponsorship: Position is not eligible for visa sponsorship Funding Source: Institutional Open Until Filled: No Special Instructions: Applicant documents include: Cover Letter Vitae Copies of unofficial transcripts Contact Information for 3 Professional References EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational institution and does not discriminate on the basis of age (40 and over), race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, ethnicity, disability, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information in the admission to, or participation in, any educational program or activity (e.g., athletics, academics and housing) which it conducts or any employment policy or practice. Background Check Statement Offers of employment are contingent upon a satisfactory background check. Apply now! Sign up for job alerts! Job Alert 617b841d Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments 23R000 - College of Ed & Appl Human Sciences 23R000 - College of Ed & Appl Human Sciences Locations Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States First Name (required) e2f0b337 Last Name (required) 9d622eb7 Email (required) 0d74418a Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Similar Jobs Graduate Assistant-School of Nursing Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States 24R000 - College of Health Sciences Graduate Assistant for the School of Nursing Assistant Director, Athletic Marketing Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States 90R000 - Intercollegiate Athletics The Assistant Director of Athletics Marketing is, responsible for developing and implementing creative marketing and promotional strategies that elevate the game day