    "https://careers.eku.edu/jobs/colonels-cupboard-student-worker-richmond-campus-kentucky-united-states": {
      "title": "Colonels Cupboard Student Worker",
      "description": "Colonels Cupboard Student Worker - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Colonels Cupboard Student Worker - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Colonels Cupboard Student Worker 497713 Richmond Campus Student Support Positions Student Closing at: Nov 24 2026 - 23:55 EST Title: Colonels Cupboard Student Worker Department: 26R100 - Ctr for Incl Excell & Global Eng Division: 5R1000 - Student Affairs Position Location: Richmond Campus Hours Per Week: 10 Posted Salary Grade: Minimum $8 an hour Contact Person: Martina Jackson Job Summary/Basic Functions The Colonels Cupboard & Closet Student Worker supports the university's efforts to address food insecurity and promote professional readiness among EKU students. Student workers are assigned to one or more of three program areas for the Colonels Closet, Colonels Cupboard, or Stockroom & Inventory based on program needs and student interest. This position offers hands-on experience in customer service, program operations, nutrition and career education, and inventory management, while directly supporting fellow students in accessing essential resources. Student workers may rotate between tracks depending on staffing needs, or may be assigned primarily to a single area. Minimum Qualifications Education: Enrolled as a full-time EKU student in good standing. Preferred Qualifications: - Currently enrolled as a EKU student in good academic standing. - Strong interpersonal and communication skills. - Dependable, punctual, and able to commit to a regular weekly schedule. - Comfortable interacting with the broader student population in a confidential, respectful manner. - Ability to lift and carry boxes or donation items (up to approximately 25 lbs). - Willingness to learn new systems and processes (e.g., inventory software). - No prior experience required; training provided. Sponsorship: This position is not eligible for visa sponsorship. EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational institution and does not discriminate on the basis of age (40 and over), race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, ethnicity, disability, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information in the admission to, or participation in, any educational program or activity (e.g., athletics, academics and housing) which it conducts or any employment policy or practice. Background Check Statement Offers of employment are contingent upon a satisfactory background check. Apply now! Sign up for job alerts! Job Alert 61267df4 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments 26R100 - Ctr for Incl Excell & Global Eng 26R100 - Ctr for Incl Excell & Global Eng Locations Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States First Name (required) efb78e77 Last Name (required) 165971a0 Email (required) 844dba7c Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Similar Jobs Graduate Assistant-School of Nursing Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States 24R000 - College of Health Sciences Graduate Assistant for the School of Nursing Assistant Director, Athletic Marketing Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States 90R000 - Intercollegiate Athletics The Assistant Director of Athletics Marketing is, responsible for developing and implementing creative marketing and promotional strategies that elevate the game day atmosphere, enhance the fan experience, and strengthen student and community engagement. This role plays a key part in supporting the overall brand of EKU Athletics while fostering a culture of excitement, school spirit, and inclusivity across all athletic programs. o Assist in the creation and execution of comprehensive marketing and promotional plans for home at