      "title": "Card Services Associate",
      "description": "Card Services Associate - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Card Services Associate - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Card Services Associate 497694 Richmond Campus Student Support Positions Student Closing at: Nov 2 2026 - 23:55 EST Title: Card Services Associate Position Type: Student Search Type: External - minimum 7 days Department: 68R000 - University Business Services Division: 4R0000 - Finance & Administration Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver FLSA: Non-Exempt Hours Per Week: Up to 20 Pay Scale: Minimum $8.00 per hour Contact Person: Lindsay James, lindsay.james@eku.edu Job Summary/Basic Functions Colonel Card Services is the first face-to-face interaction many patrons have with the university. A Card Services Associate will deliver exceptional front-line customer service to a diverse client base, including students, faculty, administrators, and university contractors. The Card Services Associate will reflect high standards and professionalism associated with EKU while upholding office and patron privacy protocols. Minimum Qualifications Applicants must be a student enrolled at EKU. Preferred Qualifications: Applicants should exhibit excellent communication skills and the discretion to uphold applicable university protocols and confidentiality obligations. Previous experience in a professional office or customer service environment is preferred. Job Duties: 75% - Print replacement ID cards for patrons - (Essential) 20% - Answer any questions from visiting patrons - (Essential) 5% - Keep the office organized and update virtual files as needed. - (Marginal) Sponsorship: The position is not eligible for visa sponsorship. EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action employer and educational institution and does not discriminate on the basis of age (40 and over), race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, g