      "description": "Registered Nurse PRN - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Registered Nurse PRN - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Registered Nurse PRN 497686 Richmond Campus Student Support Positions Part-Time Staff Closing at: Nov 17 2026 - 23:55 EST Title: Registered Nurse PRN Position Type: Part-Time Staff Search Type: External - minimum 7 days Department: 71R000 - Dean of Students Division: 5R0000 - Student Success,Opportunity&Engage Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver FLSA: Exempt Schedule Type: Part Time, No Benefits (less than 20 hrs per week) Retirement: None Contact Person: Brenda Caudill Job Summary/Basic Functions Perform competent and compassionate care to patients using nursing skills, assessment and education based on knowledge of the nursing process. Coordinate patient care as a team leader practicing Patient-Centered Medical Home principles Minimum Qualifications Education: Certification or graduation from a four (4) year college or university Licensure & Certifications: Current KY RN license Job Duties: 65% - Monitor patient vitals; detect changes in symptoms, health, and/or pain. Perform duties in compliance with care management and standing clinic orders. - (Essential) 20% - Fill out and update patient documents and charts. - (Essential) 10% - Maintain a safe and clean working environment by complying with procedures, rules, and regulations - (Essential) Sponsorship: This position is not eligible for visa sponsorship. Open Until Filled: Yes EEO Statement Eastern Kentucky University is an Equal Opportunity employer and educational institution and does not discriminate on the basis of age (40 and over), race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, ethnicity, disability, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information in the admission to, or participation in, any educational program or activity (e.g., athletics, acad