      "description": "Part-Time Faculty, Communication - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Part-Time Faculty, Communication - Richmond Campus, Kentucky, United States Kiosk mode We're Hiring! Part-Time Faculty, Communication 497502 Richmond Campus College of Letters, Arts & Soc Sciences Student Support Positions Part-Time Faculty Closing at: Nov 28 2026 - 23:55 EST Title: Part-Time Faculty, Communication Position Type: Part-Time Faculty Search Type: External - minimum 7 days Department: 21R010 - College of Letters, Arts & Soc Sci Division: 2R0000 - Academic Affairs Position Location: Richmond Campus Driver Classification: Non-Driver FLSA: Exempt Schedule Type: Part Time, No Benefits (less than 20 hrs per week) Retirement: None Contact Person: Ginny Whitehouse Job Summary/Basic Functions The department of Communication at Eastern Kentucky University invites applications for a part-time adjunct faculty position to teach face-to-face courses in Communication Studies, Broadcasting and Electronic Media (Film Techniques and Multimedia Journalism), and Public Relations at the Richmond campus. Applicants will be contacted as courses become available. Part-time faculty may teach up to nine credit hours, depending on departmental needs. Applicants will be screened and contacted as departmental needs for part-time faculty arise. Applications will be accepted on an ongoing basis. Unofficial transcripts are acceptable at the time of application. Official transcripts are required at the time of the position offer and as a condition of employment. Minimum Qualifications Education: Master's Degree in Field Preferred Qualifications: Prior university teaching experience Sponsorship: This position is not eligible for visa sponsorship. Open Until Filled: Yes Special Instructions: Applicant documents include: Identify potential application documents. (May include the following, as appropriate.) • Cover Letter • Vitae • Copies of unofficial transcripts • Contact Information for 3 